h3.modal-header.m-0(translate) Backup password
.modal-body
    p.mb-2(translate) This password is shown only once. Copy it now; it will be cleared from memory when you close this window.
    p.text-muted(*ngIf='profileCount', translate='Connections in this backup: {count}', [translateParams]='{ count: profileCount }')
    .vault-backup-passphrase(*ngIf='revealed && passphrase')
        code {{passphrase}}
    .vault-backup-passphrase.is-hidden(*ngIf='!revealed || !passphrase', translate) Password cleared from memory
    button.btn.btn-secondary.mt-3(
        type='button',
        (click)='copy()',
        [disabled]='!passphrase',
        translate
    ) Copy password
    .text-muted.mt-2(*ngIf='copied', translate) Copied. Store it in a safe place before sharing the file.

.modal-footer
    button.btn.btn-primary((click)='done()', translate) I saved the password
